MAJOR_VERSION=4
STANDARD_VERSION=0
RELEASE_VERSION=0
PRERELEASE=1
DEV_VERSION=13
DESCRIPTION=promote_preproduction_for_main.sh: GA root .ver uses DESCRIPTION (and semver / optional RELEASE_DATE) only from the GM=1 row; other preproduction .ver files are deleted with the directory. CI: check_version_entries_semver_dev_unique.sh enforces unique (MAJOR, STANDARD, RELEASE, DEV_VERSION) across version/entries (implicit DEV_VERSION=0 when omitted). Docs: docs/versioning.md, version/*/ABOUT.txt, AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, .cursor/rules/versioning.mdc, .coderabbit.yaml.
